{"id":"gamefreak-director-190","kind":"blog","title":"[GameFreak部长专栏] 第190回","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2011-03-09","publication":"増田部長のめざめるパワー 第190回","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"},{"name":"杉森建","slug":"sugimori-ken"}],"works":[{"name":"宝可梦 黑·白","slug":"black-white"}],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/entry-190/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_director_column","summary":"增田顺一分享伦敦与纽约之行的现场照片，记录发售日活动、玩家队伍、试玩会与当地宝可梦氛围。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","宝可梦","官方博客"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田部長のめざめるパワー 第190回","url":"https://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/dir/2011/03/index.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://www.gamefreak.co.jp/blog/dir/2011/03/index.html","type":"official_blog"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"这是伦敦和纽约的照片特辑！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n这就是白色地毯！右后方是“S​​ound”俱乐部的入口！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n走路中的我！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n在舞台上用英语演讲！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190d2.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n我说着“谢谢！”大概吧（笑）\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190e.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n正在进行转盘对战！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190f.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n发售日一大早，就有好多玩家排队等候！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n杉森和我正在签名！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190h.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n签名中！！\n\n去纽约\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190i.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n在新泽西的购物中心。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190j.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n这里也有那辆卡车！！！！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190k.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n和人一对比，就能看出它有多大了吧……真大……\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190l.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n前一天，也就是5日的任天堂世界。大家都排着队呢！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190m.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n里面也是人山人海……\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n活动会场的试玩机。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190o.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n捷克罗姆、莱希拉姆也来了！！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190p.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n真人版红豆杉博士。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190q.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n前往布鲁克林大桥！！对岸就是飞云市。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190r.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n七宝市。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190s.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n发售日当天！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190t.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n说到北美，那当然就是 GAME STOP！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190u.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n店里还有攻略书。\n\n不知道大家有没有感受到现场的气氛呢！？\n\n那么，再见。\n\n\n\n\n<details class=\"gf-director-language\"><summary>查看官方英文版</summary>\n\nBack in Japan!\n\nHere’s pictures of London and New York!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nThis is white carpet! Entrance of club “Sound” is all the way to the right.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nI’m walking here!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nSpeech in English on the stage!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190d.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nI guess I’m saying “Thank you” <img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/148/en/icon_wink.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190e.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nRotation battle continues!!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190f.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nMany people stand in the line on the launch day.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nMe and Sugimori, signing autograph!!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190h.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nStill signing!!\n\nHeading to New York.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190i.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nAt the shopping mall of New Jersey.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190j.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nHere is THE truck!!!!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190k.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nHere’s comparison against man… It’s huge…\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190l.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nDay before the launch at Nintendo World.\n\nPeople are making line!!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190m.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nIt’s crowded inside…\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nPlay demo machine at the event.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190o.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nHere’s Zekrom and Reshiram!!!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190p.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nReal Prof. Juniper.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190q.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nTo the Brooklyn Bridge!! Castelia City awaits us.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190r.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nNacrene City.\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190s.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nLaunch day!!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190t.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nWhen it comes to US, it’s GAME STOP!!\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/en/190u.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nThere’s a strategy guide book in the shop.\n\nI hope you can feel the atmosphere!?\n\nSee ya.\n\n\n</details>","markdown_ja":"日本に戻りました！\n\nロンドン・ＮＹの写真特集です！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nこれがホワイトカーペット！　右奥が「Ｓｏｕｎｄ」というクラブの入り口！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n歩くマスダ！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nステージで英語でスピーチ！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190d2.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n「サンキュー！」と言ってます。たぶん（笑）\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190e.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nローテーションバトル中！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190f.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n発売日、たくさん朝から並んでくれています！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190g.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n杉森とマスダサイン中！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190h.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nサイン中！！\n\nNYへ\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190i.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nニュージャージーのモールにて。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190j.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nここにも、あのトラックがっ！！！！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190k.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n人と対比すると大きさが分かりますね。。。でかい。。。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190l.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n前日５日のNINTENDO　WORLD。並んでくださってます！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190m.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n中もごった返してます。。。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nイベント会場の試遊台。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190o.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nゼクロム、レシラムも！！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190p.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nリアルアララギ博士。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190q.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nブルックリンブリッジへ！！　向こう岸がヒウンシティ。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190r.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\nシッポウシティ。\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190s.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n発売日当日！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190t.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n北米といえば、GAME　STOP！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/190/ja/190u.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n店内には攻略本も。\n\nなんとなく、空気感は伝わったでしょうか！？\n\nでは。"}}